# After the theses are published, add them under preferred-citation.
cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Population size and local-search intensity in a memetic genetic algorithm
  for the TSP: code and data
message: If you use this code or data, please cite this archived release.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Mykola
    family-names: Voinikov
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7961-5312
    affiliation: V. N. Karazin Kharkiv National University
abstract: >-
  Code and measurements for a study of how population size interacts with
  local-search intensity and the evaluation budget in a memetic genetic
  algorithm on the TSPLIB95 instance d493. Contains the sweep driver, the
  iterated-local-search control, 1152 records from 288 genetic-algorithm runs
  and 40 records from 10 control runs, and the scripts that reproduce the
  three figures.
keywords:
  - memetic algorithm
  - genetic algorithm
  - population size
  - local search
  - 2-opt
  - travelling salesman problem
  - computational budget
repository-code: https://github.com/voinikovmykola/memetic-population-size-tsp
